      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARINA BAY (2) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and four placings from 17 starts. Comes off a (16.77) win last time, scoring by a nose in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. SWIFT ETHICS (1) after finishing in the placings three back has missed the frame since but not beaten far last time when a 1.4 lengths fifth (16.92) in a Mix 5 at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. MADRID (7) is having her first start around this course. Comes here a last start placegetter at Q Lakeside in a Mix 5 (20.03). Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expected to be in the finish again. NOAKI UNO (4) placed last start from this box and is in the mix again.",
